                {
                  "id": "h-why-work-with-us",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Work with Sun State International",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "why-work-with-us"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-work-with-us-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Our customers trust us because we've earned that trust over decades. As Florida's only authorized International® truck dealer, we bring a reputation built on reliability, transparency, and care. When you source your semi truck parts through us, you're not just buying a component; you're gaining a dependable partner who values your uptime and safety above all else.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-why-work-with-us-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Certified technicians with hands-on experience in International engines"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Multiple locations across Tampa, Sarasota, Davenport, and Brooksville for convenient access"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "In-house financing options for qualified customers"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Online ordering and pickup to simplify your maintenance schedule"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-work-with-us-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "No matter what you drive, our goal is to keep you moving with the right part, at the right price, installed by the right people.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-dependable-parts",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Dependable Parts. Exceptional Service.",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "dependable-parts"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-dependable-parts-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When it comes to aftermarket semi truck parts, reliability depends on one thing: who you buy from. That's why Sun State International's service department treats every truck like it's our own. Whether you're replacing a part, scheduling preventive maintenance, or deciding between OEM and aftermarket, our promise is the same: dependable parts, honest service, and a team that keeps your business moving forward.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-dependable-parts-2",
                  "type": "text",
